<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Sustainability | REVIVO</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('../partials/user/header') %>

<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-center mb-8 md:mb-12 text-[#2C2C2C]">Our Sustainability Commitment</h1>
    
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#f8f7f5] via-[#f8c78d]/20 to-[#f8f7f5] p-8 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-[#2C2C2C] mb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
          <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M5 3v4M3 5h4M6 17v4m-2-2h4m5-16l2.286 6.857L21 12l-5.714 2.143L13 21l-2.286-6.857L5 12l5.714-2.143L13 3z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold mb-4 text-center text-[#2C2C2C]">Fashion With Purpose</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
        At REVIVO, sustainability isn't just a buzzword—it's a core value that guides every decision we make. We believe that reviving vintage styles should also mean reviving responsible practices from an era when clothing was made to last and cherished for years.
      </p>
      
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
        Our approach to sustainability focuses on three key pillars: thoughtful materials, ethical production, and longevity by design. We're committed to continuous improvement, transparency, and making choices that respect both people and planet.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16 relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#2C2C2C]/5 z-0 rounded-lg"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 p-8">
        <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#f8c78d]/30 flex items-center justify-center">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C] text-center">Materials That Matter</h2>
        <div class="md:flex md:gap-8">
          <div class="md:w-1/2">
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
              We carefully select materials that minimize environmental impact while maximizing quality and durability. Our fabric sourcing prioritizes:
            </p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
              <li>Organic and responsibly grown natural fibers</li>
              <li>Recycled and upcycled materials</li>
              <li>Low-impact dyes and finishing processes</li>
              <li>Deadstock fabrics that would otherwise go to waste</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="md:w-1/2">
            <div class="p-4 border border-[#2C2C2C]/20 rounded-lg bg-white shadow-sm">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
                <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#2C2C2C]"></div>
                <span class="font-semibold text-[#2C2C2C]">2025 Goal</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                By 2025, we aim to have 80% of our materials come from certified sustainable sources, with complete traceability throughout our supply chain.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16 bg-[#f8f7f5] rounded-lg p-8 border-r-4 border-[#f8c78d]">
      <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#2C2C2C]/10 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C] text-center">Ethical Production</h2>
      <div class="md:flex md:gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="md:w-1/2 mb-6 md:mb-0">
          <div class="relative">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 border-2 border-dashed border-[#2C2C2C]/20 rounded-lg transform rotate-1"></div>
            <div class="relative bg-white p-5 rounded-lg shadow-sm transform -rotate-1">
              <p class="text-gray-700 italic">
                "We regularly visit our production partners and maintain open communication to ensure our standards are consistently met and to build lasting relationships based on mutual respect."
              </p>
              <div class="mt-4 flex justify-end">
                <span class="text-sm text-[#2C2C2C] font-semibold">— REVIVO Commitment</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="md:w-1/2">
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            We partner exclusively with manufacturers who share our values and meet our strict standards for:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 mb-4">
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#2C2C2C] mr-2 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
              </svg>
              <span class="text-gray-700">Fair wages and safe working conditions</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#2C2C2C] mr-2 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
              </svg>
              <span class="text-gray-700">Transparent business practices</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#2C2C2C] mr-2 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
              </svg>
              <span class="text-gray-700">Environmental responsibility in manufacturing</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-[#2C2C2C] mr-2 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
              </svg>
              <span class="text-gray-700">Skilled craftsmanship and quality construction</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <div class="relative rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#2C2C2C]/5 z-0"></div>
        <div class="relative z-10 p-8">
          <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-[#f8c78d]/30 flex items-center justify-center">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-[#2C2C2C]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-[#2C2C2C] text-center">Designed for Longevity</h2>
          
          <div class="md:flex md:gap-8 items-center">
            <div class="md:w-1/2 mb-6 md:mb-0">
              <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
                <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                  The most sustainable garment is the one that lasts. We design our pieces to transcend seasonal trends and withstand years of wear:
                </p>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                  <div class="border border-[#2C2C2C]/10 rounded p-3 bg-[#f8f7f5]">
                    <div class="font-medium text-[#2C2C2C] mb-1">Timeless Design</div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Silhouettes that won't quickly go out of style</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="border border-[#2C2C2C]/10 rounded p-3 bg-[#f8f7f5]">
                    <div class="font-medium text-[#2C2C2C] mb-1">Durable Construction</div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Reinforced techniques at stress points</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="border border-[#2C2C2C]/10 rounded p-3 bg-[#f8f7f5]">
                    <div class="font-medium text-[#2C2C2C] mb-1">Quality Materials</div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Fabrics that improve with age</p>
                  </div>
                  <div class="border border-[#2C2C2C]/10 rounded p-3 bg-[#f8f7f5]">
                    <div class="font-medium text-[#2C2C2C] mb-1">Versatile Styling</div>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">Multiple ways to wear each piece</p>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-1/2">
              <div class="bg-[#2C2C2C] text-white p-6 rounded-lg">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-medium mb-4 flex items-center">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
                  </svg>
                  Repair Services
                </h3>
                <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed">
                  We offer repair services for our garments to extend their lifespan even further, keeping quality pieces in your wardrobe and out of landfills.
                </p>
                <div class="flex justify-end">
                  <a href="#" class="text-[#f8c78d] hover:underline text-sm font-medium">Learn more about our repair program →</a>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-lg shadow-sm mb-12 md:mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4 text-center text-[#2C2C2C]">Our Progress and Commitments</h2>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-6">
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#2C2C2C] mb-2">65%</div>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Sustainable materials used in our current collection</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#2C2C2C] mb-2">100%</div>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Plastic-free packaging for all shipments</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-center">
          <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#2C2C2C] mb-2">-30%</div>
          <p class="text-gray-700">Carbon footprint reduction since 2020</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <p class="text-gray-700 text-center">
        We're proud of our progress, but we know there's always more work to be done. View our complete <a href="#" class="text-[#2C2C2C] underline">Sustainability Report</a> for detailed information.
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-6 text-[#2C2C2C]">Join Our Sustainable Journey</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Sustainability is a collective effort. We invite you to be part of our journey by caring for your REVIVO pieces, sharing your sustainability ideas, and holding us accountable to our commitments.
      </p>
      
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/contact" class="bg-[#2C2C2C] text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-black transition duration-300">Contact Us</a>
        <a href="/shop" class="border border-[#2C2C2C] text-[#2C2C2C] px-6 py-3 rounded-md hover:bg-gray-100 transition duration-300">Shop Sustainable</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('../partials/user/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
